{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44246076",
      "title": "Using the \"pending\" State from useActionState()",
      "sourceHash": "c6193720e5d06a6f22b41062876e0fc208b81b2d917ff19c8602d134209da8f2",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.04,
          "end": 4.05,
          "en": "So how could we improve",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.05,
          "end": 5.97,
          "en": "the user experience here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.97,
          "end": 9.84,
          "en": "Well, for example, by again, disabling these buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.84,
          "end": 12.33,
          "en": "after they have been clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.33,
          "end": 14.85,
          "en": "And I wanna disable both buttons if one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.85,
          "end": 18.12,
          "en": "of them has been clicked so that we have to wait",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.12,
          "end": 22.173,
          "en": "for the vote to be registered before we can vote again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.16,
          "end": 28.16,
          "en": "Now we could use this useFormStatus hook for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.92,
          "end": 30.36,
          "en": "but in order to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.36,
          "end": 32.52,
          "en": "we would have to outsource these buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.52,
          "end": 35.76,
          "en": "into separate components, as you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.76,
          "end": 37.5,
          "en": "And of course we can do that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 39.723,
          "en": "There's nothing wrong with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.83,
          "end": 45.06,
          "en": "But here, I'll show you another way of handling this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 45.06,
          "end": 48.72,
          "en": "because instead of outsourcing the buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.72,
          "end": 53.13,
          "en": "we can use the useActionState hook, which you already know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.13,
          "end": 55.5,
          "en": "because as I already mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 60.27,
          "en": "this hook also gives us this pending information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.27,
          "end": 61.44,
          "en": "So this information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.44,
          "end": 63.963,
          "en": "whether the form is currently being submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.15,
          "end": 69.39,
          "en": "Here, I have to call this hook twice though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.39,
          "end": 71.52,
          "en": "because I have two actions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.52,
          "end": 74.343,
          "en": "and one hook can only handle one action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 75.21000000000001,
          "end": 78.303,
          "en": "So the first hook here handles upvoteAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.17,
          "end": 80.82,
          "en": "and the second time I call it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.82,
          "end": 82.623,
          "en": "I want to handle the downvoteAction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 86.73,
          "en": "Now the initial form state is null",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.73,
          "end": 89.943,
          "en": "because I don't manage any form state here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 90.9,
          "end": 93.66,
          "en": "We could also omit this therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 97.083,
          "en": "and not pass any initial state to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.95,
          "end": 99.57,
          "en": "And then just as before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.57,
          "end": 104.28,
          "en": "we'll of course get back those elements I mentioned before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.28,
          "end": 106.593,
          "en": "So we'll get that upvoteFormState,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.03,
          "end": 112.32,
          "en": "we get an upvoteAction, an upvoteFormAction",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.32,
          "end": 113.88,
          "en": "if we want to call it like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.88,
          "end": 116.07300000000001,
          "en": "so that we don't have any name clashes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.357,
          "end": 119.82,
          "en": "And the information whether this upvote form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.82,
          "end": 121.023,
          "en": "is currently pending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.58,
          "end": 124.02,
          "en": "And of course the same is true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.02,
          "end": 126.36,
          "en": "for the second time we call this hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 126.36,
          "end": 129.51,
          "en": "But now it's all about downvoting here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.51,
          "end": 133.29,
          "en": "So downvoteFormState, downvoteFormAction,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.29,
          "end": 134.493,
          "en": "and downvotePending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.47,
          "end": 140.557,
          "en": "Now I don't care about the states here to be honest,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.557,
          "end": 142.82999999999998,
          "en": "but when destructuring the array like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.82999999999998,
          "end": 146.703,
          "en": "I still have to extract those elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 148.5,
          "end": 151.53,
          "en": "But here I'm now mostly interested in the actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 151.53,
          "end": 153.32999999999998,
          "en": "and the pending states.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 153.32999999999998,
          "end": 156.99,
          "en": "So it's now the upvoteFormAction that's set as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 156.99,
          "end": 159.09,
          "en": "for the first button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.09,
          "end": 162.12,
          "en": "So this upvoteFormAction is set as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.12,
          "end": 164.55,
          "en": "for this first button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 164.55,
          "end": 167.64,
          "en": "And downvoteFormAction is set as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 167.64,
          "end": 170.613,
          "en": "for the second button, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.87,
          "end": 174.78,
          "en": "Well, and then we can use these pending states",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 174.78,
          "end": 177.42000000000002,
          "en": "to disable these buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.42000000000002,
          "end": 182.42,
          "en": "So the first button is disabled if upvote is pending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.91,
          "end": 188.31,
          "en": "or if downvote is pending.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 188.31,
          "end": 191.28,
          "en": "So if either of these two buttons has been pressed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.28,
          "end": 193.41,
          "en": "that's the idea here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 193.41,
          "end": 195.96,
          "en": "And therefore it's exactly the same code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.96,
          "end": 198.483,
          "en": "that should be added to the second button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.49,
          "end": 204.09,
          "en": "And with this adjustment made, if you go back,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204.09,
          "end": 208.35,
          "en": "if you reload, if you click the up upvote button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 208.35,
          "end": 210.93,
          "en": "for example, you see the buttons are disabled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 210.93,
          "end": 215.19299999999998,
          "en": "until this up upvote has been registered and handled.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 216.3,
          "end": 219.06,
          "en": "And the same is true for downvoting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 219.06,
          "end": 222.42000000000002,
          "en": "So that's now arguably a better user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 222.42000000000002,
          "end": 225.423,
          "en": "But we can do even better than that.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}